DESCRIPTION:Program registration is recommended but not required. \n\n \n\n
 Yoga is an ancient practice and lifestyle that encourages a healthy body\,
  mind\, and spirit. It enhances flexibility\, strength\, and internal harm
 ony. In partnership with Golden Road Healing\, Pratt Library is excited to
  bring patrons a unique yoga experience\, that incorporates the power of s
 ound healing\, simple guided meditation\, and movement to create an hour o
 f mindfulness and restoration.\n\n \n\nThis gentle practice is open to all
  skill levels\, where instructors will demonstrate various adaptations thr
 oughout the practice. This practice is focused primarily on participants f
 eeling fully at peace within their bodies\, and participants are encourage
 d to embrace their bodies' abilities or limitations for the day within thi
 s judgment-free environment. If there are any postures out of your comfort
  zone you are invited to sit back and relax while musical instruments are 
 played. This experience is meant to be for everyone!
GEO:39.294601;-76.617302
LOCATION:Central Library\, Creative Arts Center
SUMMARY:Morning Mindfulness: Yoga with Golden Road Healing
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.prattlibrary.org/event/morning-mindfulness-y
 oga-with-golden-road-healing-10-16-2026
CATEGORIES:Health & Wellness
END:VEVENT
